    "title": "Hid Macro",
    "thumbnailUrl": "assets/thumb.png",
    "briefDescription": "A python based cli utility to record and replay user HID actions",
    "fullDescription": "# HID Macro Recorder \\ud83c\\udfa5\\ud83d\\uddb1\\ufe0f\\u2328\\ufe0f\\r\\n\\r\\nRecord and replay mouse and keyboard actions on Windows.\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\ud83d\\udd27 Features\\r\\n\\r\\n- Start/stop recording with `F9/F10`\\r\\n- Replay once with `F11`\\r\\n- Loop random routines forever with `F12`\\r\\n- Stop playback with `ESC`\\r\\n- Delete last recorded routine with `F6`\\r\\n- Clear memory routine with `F8`\\r\\n- Exit with `F7`\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\ud83d\\ude80 Installation\\r\\n\\r\\n```bash\\r\\npip install hid-macro\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\u2328\\ufe0f Hotkeys\\r\\n\\r\\n| Key     | Action                      |\\r\\n|--------|-----------------------------|\\r\\n| F9     | Start recording             |\\r\\n| F10    | Stop recording & save       |\\r\\n| F11    | Replay first routine        |\\r\\n| F12    | Loop through random routines|\\r\\n| F6     | Delete last saved routine   |\\r\\n| F8     | Clear current memory routine|\\r\\n| F7     | Quit                        |\\r\\n| ESC    | Stop replay                 |\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\ud83d\\udce6 Usage\\r\\n\\r\\nAfter install, launch it with:\\r\\n```bash\\r\\nhid-macro\\r\\n```\\r\\nOr run from source:\\r\\n```bash\\r\\npython -m hid_macro.main\\r\\n```\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\ud83d\\udcc1 Routines\\r\\nAll routines are saved as .json files in the routines/ folder relative to the installed package.\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\ud83d\\udee0 Dependencies\\r\\npyautogui\\r\\n\\r\\npynput\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n \\r\\nMade with \\u2764\\ufe0f for power users and tinkerers.",
